<spell-notebook "comment theming">
	<header level="1">
		Comment
		<header>A comment displays user feedback to site content.</>
	</>
	<comment-tab-bar showing="theming"/>
	<section>
		<menu class="ui-docs-section-tabs" appearance="segmented" aria-label="Sections">
			<item link="#tokens">Tokens</>
			<item link="#themes">Themes</>
		</>
	</>

	<!-- THEMING:  the family's tokens, live, plus how to set them and which themes touch it. -->
	<section label="Tokens">
		<markdown>
			Theme with the public `--ui-comments-*` and `--ui-comment-*` tokens: set one on the list, on any ancestor (`:root`
			for every list), or on its box through `::part(comments)`. Its comments and threads inherit them.

			The parts inside a comment also read a few tokens that are unset by default, so they are not in the table:

			- `--ui-comment-avatar-width` (`2.5em`)
			- `--ui-comment-content-margin` (`3.5em`, the space beside the avatar)
			- `--ui-comment-author-color`, `--ui-comment-meta-color`, `--ui-comment-text-color` and
			  `--ui-comment-action-color`
		</>
		<markdown>
			```css
			ui-comments {
			  --ui-comments-max-width: 50em;
			  --ui-comment-distance: 1em;
			  --ui-comment-avatar-width: 3em;
			  --ui-comment-content-margin: 4em;
			}
			```
		</>
		<message state="info" size="small">
			<markdown>
				the `minimal` look, `threaded` and `inverted` are switches the top list sets for its threads and parts; use the
				attributes. Never set the `--_ui-*` / `--_comments-*` names (`--_ui-comments-minimal` ...): they're the sheet's
				private plumbing.
			</>
		</>
		<markdown>Edit a value below to try it.</>
		<html>
			<ui-docs-tokens family="ui-comment" playground>
				<ui-comments>
					<ui-header level="3" dividing>Comments</>
					<ui-comment>
						<ui-avatar src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns=%22http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%22 width=%22200%22 height=%22200%22 viewBox=%220 0 10 10%22%3E%3Crect width=%2210%22 height=%2210%22 fill=%22%2394a3b8%22/%3E%3Ccircle cx=%225%22 cy=%224%22 r=%222%22 fill=%22%23e2e8f0%22/%3E%3C/svg%3E"></>
						<ui-content>
							<ui-author link="#matt">Matt</>
							<ui-meta>
								<ui-text>Today at 5:42PM</>
							</>
							<ui-description>How artistic!</>
							<ui-actions>
								<ui-button type="button">Reply</>
							</>
						</>
					</>
					<ui-comment>
						<ui-avatar src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns=%22http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%22 width=%22200%22 height=%22200%22 viewBox=%220 0 10 10%22%3E%3Crect width=%2210%22 height=%2210%22 fill=%22%2394a3b8%22/%3E%3Ccircle cx=%225%22 cy=%224%22 r=%222%22 fill=%22%23e2e8f0%22/%3E%3C/svg%3E"></>
						<ui-content>
							<ui-author link="#elliot-fu">Elliot Fu</>
							<ui-meta>
								<ui-text>Yesterday at 12:30AM</>
							</>
							<ui-description>This has been very useful for my research. Thanks as well!</>
							<ui-actions>
								<ui-button type="button">Reply</>
							</>
						</>
						<ui-comments>
							<ui-comment>
								<ui-avatar src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns=%22http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%22 width=%22200%22 height=%22200%22 viewBox=%220 0 10 10%22%3E%3Crect width=%2210%22 height=%2210%22 fill=%22%2394a3b8%22/%3E%3Ccircle cx=%225%22 cy=%224%22 r=%222%22 fill=%22%23e2e8f0%22/%3E%3C/svg%3E"></>
								<ui-content>
									<ui-author link="#jenny-hess">Jenny Hess</>
									<ui-meta>
										<ui-text>Just now</>
									</>
									<ui-description>Elliot you are always so right :)</>
									<ui-actions>
										<ui-button type="button">Reply</>
									</>
								</>
							</>
						</>
					</>
					<ui-comment>
						<ui-avatar src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns=%22http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%22 width=%22200%22 height=%22200%22 viewBox=%220 0 10 10%22%3E%3Crect width=%2210%22 height=%2210%22 fill=%22%2394a3b8%22/%3E%3Ccircle cx=%225%22 cy=%224%22 r=%222%22 fill=%22%23e2e8f0%22/%3E%3C/svg%3E"></>
						<ui-content>
							<ui-author link="#joe-henderson">Joe Henderson</>
							<ui-meta>
								<ui-text>5 days ago</>
							</>
							<ui-description>Dude, this is awesome. Thanks so much</>
							<ui-actions>
								<ui-button type="button">Reply</>
							</>
						</>
					</>
					<ui-form slot="reply">
						<ui-field>
							<ui-textarea aria-label="Reply"></>
						</>
						<ui-button type="submit" color="primary">Add Reply</>
					</>
				</>
			</>
		</>
	</>

	<section label="Themes">
		<markdown>
			The theme menu above picks the theme for every page of the site:  Spell, Glass, Fruity or Merlot,
			each restyling this component through its tokens.
		</>
	</>
</spell-notebook>
